  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have a really old 8k picture of a stick man uploaded to my VRChat gallery. During one of the updates to this game, VRChat limited the maximum download size that the client can use for a picture. Because of this, if I try to view this image in-game with the gallery, it just throws a \"No Image Found\" at me, and I can't see it unless I look at the preview of that picture in the menu.\n\nHowever, I still have the option to create emojis and stickers with that image.\n\nIf I decided that I wanted to use that image as an emoji or a sticker, then click one of those buttons to make them, the client doesn't show the emoji/sticker creation UI and, shortly after I click it, crashes the game.\n\nThis bug probably isn't all that important, but I thought I'd post it anyway because its funny. I used to use that image to create \"\"Real\"\" \"No Image Found\" emojis, lol.",
